              "starterCode": "-- Schema is pre-seeded in stdin.\n-- Write a query to select hostname and ram_mb for online nodes with >= 8192 MB RAM:\nSELECT hostname, ram_mb \nFROM nodes \nWHERE status = 'online' AND ram_mb >= 8192;"
