              "prompt": "Query the `processes` table to find the top 3 processes consuming the most CPU (`cpu_percent` in descending order). In the event of a tie, sort by `pid` ascending. Select `pid`, `name`, and `cpu_percent`.",
              "objectiveId": "sql-order-limit",
