              "prompt": "From the `staff` table, write a query to output each `dept` along with the number of employees (`emp_count`) and average salary (`avg_salary` rounded to 2 decimal places using `ROUND(AVG(salary), 2)`). Only include departments with at least 2 employees (`COUNT(*) >= 2`). Sort by `avg_salary` descending.",
              "objectiveId": "sql-aggregates-grouping",
              "starterCode": "-- Summarize staff departments with at least 2 employees:\nSELECT \n  dept, \n  COUNT(*) AS emp_count, \n  ROUND(AVG(salary), 2) AS avg_salary\nFROM staff\nGROUP BY dept\nHAVING COUNT(*) >= 2\nORDER BY avg_salary DESC;"
